# STEP 10e (R5-001): P03 closed-set multi-primary subject subcases (Mode17 reverse). RESERVATION
# (0x23) and SCHEDULER_OWNER (0x26) select their true primary by the source body owner_kind:
# RES ok=1->SERVICE / ok=2->ANCHOR / ok=3->ORDERED_INGRESS; SCHED ok=1->ANCHOR / ok=2->DELIVERY /
# ok=3->ORDERED_INGRESS. The ORDERED_INGRESS primary is a synthetic D1-legal row whose key identity
# and body ordered_sequence equal the source subject raw (d3s1 make_ordered_ingress_body_with_seq).
