# A2-b D3-S4 suffix vector generation (§18.15.15 coverage 26/26)
# ===========================================================================
#
# Vectors are produced deterministically from RefSession drives. `generate`
# appends them after the frozen 283-object prefix; `check` rebuilds the exact
# same suffix (independent re-drive) and compares for byte equality, then runs
# the D1-legality gate, the coverage 26/26 gate, and the prefix-283 pin.

